; fas9_example.scr - the form of a phase 9 family's facit script (step 9.0). Run it with
;   python -I tools/fas9_facit_run.py doc/facit/fas9_example.scr --out <directory>
; which starts AutoCAD 2025's core on acad.dwt (a new empty drawing) and expands the two markers below. A family step
; copies this form to doc/facit/fas9_<family>.scr and draws or changes what its F9 items ask for.
;
; Plain AutoCAD commands, one input per line, no LISP (the core has none). An empty line is Enter, as in AutoCAD's own
; scripts; a line that starts with ; is a comment. The commands are the English ones with the underscore prefix.
; A command the core does not have stops the script: the family step then calls that branch "ej testat" and names
; the F9 id (plan 2026-10-27-fas-9-typer.md, Facit).
;
; ;SAVE <theme> [<change>]  saves the open drawing in R12, 2000, 2004, 2007, 2010, 2013 and 2018, ASCII and binary.
;                           One change per pair: save the state, change one property, list or relation, save again
;                           with a <change> name.
; ;EXPECT <NAME> ...        the 2018 file must have a record of each name; without it the run is not a new facit.
_.LINE
0,0
100,50

_.CIRCLE
50,50
20
;EXPECT LINE CIRCLE
;SAVE example
_.MOVE
_L

0,0
10,10
;SAVE example moved
